 doing  anything myself and so that process  works really well so it's no interviews  no resumes no cover letters we're  leading with what we stand for leading  with your one where you have a skill  testing question in a long boring ugly  formatted job description do a paid  trial give them five hours or something  you think you do in one to two hours and  then see who blows you away and I've had  tremendous experience and tremendous  happiness and success in bringing people  on board and that's a process that I  that I follow after years of doing it  the wrong way doing it the way that  everybody tells you to do it but it  doesn't work it's broken and and so many  entrepreneurs struggle through that and  finding the right person is so critical  for your business to help you focus on  the big picture the CEO time so I hope  that helps for those of you who are  struggling and for those of you who've  had success in hiring I'd love to hear  what you think leave it in the comments  below I think by sharing your  experiences you could also help the  other people watching so they can get  deeper insights how to hire the right  person thank you guys for watching  continue to believe and I'll see you  soon
 

